">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Postos de abastecimento l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido no percurso e na meta<\/div><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83c\udf92 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Material Obrigat\u00f3rio:<\/strong> Dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional e reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua\/copo pr\u00f3prio.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2 de Maio de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:15 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: Sem tempo limite estrito<\/span><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83d\udca7 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Abastecimentos:<\/strong> Abastecimento no percurso e refor\u00e7o final na meta<\/div><div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 12px; margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.4;\">\ud83c\udf92 <strong style=\"color: #E2E8F0;\">Material Obrigat\u00f3rio:<\/strong> Dorsal vis\u00edvel, \u00e1gua e cal\u00e7ado adequado a trilhos.<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Lobo Ib\u00e9rico Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O <strong>Lobo Ib\u00e9rico Trail 2027 (LIT II)<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>2 de maio de 2027<\/strong>, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, secretariado, partidas e chegada no <strong>Est\u00e1dio das Seixas<\/strong>, na vila da Malveira, concelho de Mafra (distrito de Lisboa).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do evento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa integra tr\u00eas vertentes: o <strong>Trail Longo (25 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>08:30<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto (15 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva (10 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s <strong>09:15<\/strong>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Lobo Ib\u00e9rico Trail e qual \u00e9 o limite de participantes?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela <strong>MSTT \u2013 Malveira Serra Trail Team Associa\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong> e pelo <strong>Atl\u00e9tico Clube da Malveira<\/strong>, contando com um limite global de <strong>500 vagas<\/strong>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quando abre o regulamento de 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A p\u00e1gina oficial da edi\u00e7\u00e3o de 2027 j\u00e1 se encontra registada com 500 vagas, encontrando-se a tabela de pre\u00e7os por fases e o regulamento detalhado de 2027 em fase de publica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dos participantes?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A participa\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal (com chip eletr\u00f3nico nas dist\u00e2ncias competitivas), seguro de acidentes pessoais, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos durante a prova e na meta, lembran\u00e7a finisher e utiliza\u00e7\u00e3o dos balne\u00e1rios do Est\u00e1dio das Seixas.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Lobo Ib\u00e9rico Trail 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-02\", \"endDate\": \"2027-05-02\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Malveira, Mafra\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mafra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"Participa no Lobo Ib\u00e9rico Trail 2027 a 2 de maio na Malveira, Mafra. Trail Longo 25 km, Trail Curto 15 km e Caminhada 10 km no Est\u00e1dio das Seixas. Inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-lobo-iberico-trail.webp\"], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"MSTT \u2013 Malveira Serra Trail Team Associa\u00e7\u00e3o e Atl\u00e9tico Clube da Malveira\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": []}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":73129,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57329","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-mafra-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-lobo-iberico-trail.webp","ams_acf